sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client
  participant G as Gateway
  participant R as Scheduler
  participant E as Model server
  C->>G: POST /v1/chat/completions (stream=true)
  G->>G: authenticate, check tenant token quota
  G->>R: request + estimated tokens (prompt + max_tokens)
  alt KV budget available
    R->>E: admit to running batch
    E->>E: prefill: process prompt (compute-bound)
    E-->>C: first token (TTFT)
    loop decode (memory-bandwidth-bound)
      E-->>C: next token (inter-token latency)
    end
    E->>R: release KV blocks
  else budget exhausted
    R-->>G: queue (priority class) or 429 + Retry-After
  end
  G->>G: record usage (prompt + completion tokens)
